                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Hello, Hilltop Gym. — Hi, I'm interested in your yoga classes. — Sure. We have beginners on Tuesday at seven, and intermediate on Thursday at half past six. — Beginners, please. How much is it? — It's twelve pounds per class, or forty pounds for a block of four. — I'll take the block. Do I need to bring anything? — Just a towel; we provide the mats. — And what's your instructor's name? — Her name's Maria Lindqvist — that's L-I-N-D-Q-V-I-S-T.”"
